  "title": "L3Harris Delivering Counter-Drone Systems to US Army",
  "summary": "L3Harris Technologies has been selected by the U.S. Army to deliver VAMPIRE™ counter-unmanned systems (c-UxS) to support urgent defense against hostile drones. The Army’s order is worth up to $106 million as part of the United States’ layered c-UxS defense approach.",
